tils", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConcatTextOfUtils"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [175], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 340], "pos": [190.65386962890625, -71.4901123046875], "widgets_values": ["auto", "english", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 158, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 131, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_alekpet", "ver": "1.0.73", "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [364.9883728027344, 192.63677978515625], "pos": [765.020263671875, -232.77804565429688], "widgets_values": ["in the style of FeiGiap,full-body, front view, standing straight, arms slightly extended downward and away from the body forming an A shape, hands relaxed and slightly inward, neutral facial expression, legs shoulder-width apart, symmetrical posture, Male, about twenty years old, has a thin face, a tired color between her eyebrows, fair skin, straight nose, and thin and red lips. The hair was tied up and fixed with a simple wooden hairpin, with a few strands of broken hair hanging on the forehead. I was wearing a white-washed blue cloth gown with bristles on the cuffs and the texture was rough. Wear black cloth shoes with slight wear on the upper.", "in the style of FeiGiap,Under the eaves of the ancient temple, there is a straw mat for people to rest on the ground. The rain falls along the eaves. At night, the view is far and the space is dim. The house is illuminated by only a white candle standing on the stone platform in the corner. The candlelight was beating, and the orange-yellow light casts trembling spots on the bluestone floor and walls. The roof is composed of interlaced dark wooden beams, thick and low, with no visible gaps, and the shadows between the top beams are thick, covering the entire upper structure. The surface of the wooden beams is covered with dust and insect-eaten marks, and the gaps are filled with dry moss.\n\nA statue of the god in the house sat in the darkness, half of which was hidden in the shadow, and the straw mud tire was exposed on its broken shoulders, and the residual paint was mottled like rust. The altar is tilted, and the legs pull out blurry and twisted shadows on the earthen wall. The table top is covered with thick dust, and the pottery bowl on the side is cracked, with a cool white reflection.\n\nThe wall is piled with yellow mud, partially peeling off, revealing the wheat straw structure. The corners of the wall are wrapped around spiders, and the overall environment is dim.", [false, true]], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 177, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 145, "type": "PreviewTextNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_alekpet", "ver": "1.0.73", "Node name for S&R": "PreviewTextNode"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [158], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-510.1639404296875, -160.42430114746094], "widgets_values": ["古寺屋檐下，地上铺着一个供人休息的草垫子，雨水沿屋檐落下，夜晚时分，视角远景，空间昏暗，屋内仅靠一支立在墙角石台上的白蜡烛照明。烛火跳动，橙黄微光在青石地面和墙壁上投下颤抖光斑。屋顶由交错的深色木梁构成，厚重低垂，无可见缝隙，顶梁间阴影浓重，笼罩整个上方结构。木梁表面布满尘土与虫蛀痕迹，缝隙处塞满干枯苔藓。\n\n屋内一座神像坐于昏暗中，半边隐于暗影之中，残破的肩部露出稻草泥胎，残漆斑驳如锈。供桌倾斜，桌腿在土墙上拉出模糊扭曲的阴影，桌面满是厚厚灰尘，旁侧陶碗破裂，泛着冷白色反光。\n\n墙面由黄泥堆筑，部分剥落，露出麦秆结构。墙角缠绕着蛛网，整体环境昏暗。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 123, "type": "JjkText", "title": "用户提示词", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Jjk-Nodes", "ver": "b3c99bb78a99551776b5eab1a820e1cd58f84f31", "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue":